# wildscout.org - SEO Agent Pack schedule
# STATUS: INSTALLED on this machine (bb@antiX) as of 2026-07-26. This file is the source of
# truth -- if you edit it, re-sync the live crontab:
#   crontab -l > /tmp/current.cron ; edit /tmp/current.cron to match this file's job lines ;
#   crontab /tmp/current.cron
# (review /tmp/current.cron before installing; do not overwrite any other existing cron jobs)
#
# PATH is also set inside run-wildscout.org.sh itself (belt and suspenders), since cron's
# own PATH is minimal and does not source .bashrc/.profile -- claude lives in ~/.local/bin,
# node/npx come from nvm.
PATH=/home/bb/.local/bin:/home/bb/.nvm/versions/node/v24.18.0/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/local/games:/usr/games:/sbin:/usr/sbin

# Daily auto-indexing (Google Indexing API + Bing IndexNow), 1:30am. Runs before the
# content jobs below so newly-published pages from a prior day's run get submitted
# promptly. On Sundays this also runs the weekly sitemap resubmit + not-indexed report.
30 1 * * *     /home/bb/seo-agent-pack/scripts/run-wildscout.org.sh index

# Sunday full optimization run (page audit + internal linking + summary), 3am
0 3 * * 0      /home/bb/seo-agent-pack/scripts/run-wildscout.org.sh sunday

# Article night: Mon / Wed / Fri, 4am
0 4 * * 1,3,5  /home/bb/seo-agent-pack/scripts/run-wildscout.org.sh article

# Page night: Tue / Thu / Sat, 4am
0 4 * * 2,4,6  /home/bb/seo-agent-pack/scripts/run-wildscout.org.sh page

# Deferred image generation: picks up any prompts the article/page write-step saved to
# status/pending-images/ and generates them via a plain deterministic loop (see design notes in
# generate-pending-images.sh for why this, not agent-orchestrated backgrounding, is what actually
# fixes the 2026-07-29 timeout). Runs daily -- idempotent and self-healing, so it also catches up
# after any prior failed run, not just the night's own job.
35 4 * * *     /home/bb/seo-agent-pack/scripts/generate-pending-images.sh
